SUMMARY:The Toronto Cactus and Succulent Club (TCSC) Annual Show and Sale
DESCRIPTION:The Toronto Cactus and Succulent Club (TCSC) is pleased to invite you to our annual Show and Sale\, a favourite event for plant enthusiasts.\n\n\n\nJoin us to spend the day enjoying an impressive display of unique plants from around the world\, expert guidance from experienced growers\, and the opportunity to connect with fellow enthusiasts. \n\n\n\nSunday\, June 14\, 10 a.m. to 4 p.m.\n\n\n\nFloral Hall. Admission is free. \n\n\n\nA key feature of the day is the judging of members’ cacti and other succulents. Accredited judges evaluate the plants using established standards\, along with their extensive knowledge and experience. \n\n\n\nA wide selection of cacti and succulents will be available for purchase\, including many varieties not commonly found elsewhere. Whether you are an experienced collector or new to these fascinating plants\, there is something for everyone. \n\n\n\nWe hope to see you there!
URL:https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/event/the-toronto-cactus-and-succulent-club-tcsc-annual-show-and-sale/
LOCATION:ON
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Echinopsis-hybrid-DCN1991Jan250-527.jpg
END:VEVENT
